{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/jTjSD-P6nobeRS6Tj7FmxQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:56.120040+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/jTjSD-P6nobeRS6Tj7FmxQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/6jsOs04VPITgjuzrLicibHTUrkzCn6HroWMTQBeXIt2VabxponPviaXA0cvDkiaVhTYx1lhicj6aiaoiaUtr7eENR0dnYOUnQPm6HQ30vsIaLBCag0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>兽医学院是华南农业大学最早设立的学院之一，历史悠久，学科特色突出，师资力量雄厚。学院现有正高职称41人，副高职职称56人，博士生导师38人，学术型硕士生导师85人，专业学位硕士生导师96人。</span></p><p><span>学院现有兽医学学术博士学位授权点、兽医专业博士学位授权点，兽医学学术硕士学位授权点，兽医专业硕士学位授权点。</span></p><p><span>学院现开展接收推免生报名工作，欢迎广大推免生报名！</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>接收推荐免试专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/6jsOs04VPIThpiaQuX8Kyfk7PlLdsNYn69LWGKLEKxNPPUXYyic47DfdNwal7xPicvxM9zARJ852C1jacZUF18XqZyAhIgQN2OPAytN61TWSSs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>注意：最终招生专业以研招网“推免服务系统”公布为准</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请及资格审核</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.为方便考生报名，2027年学校启用“华南农业大学硕士（推荐免试）研究生招生预报名系统”，教育部推免服务系统开通前，申请免试攻读我校2027年全日制研究生的考生，可于9月20日前登陆https://yjsglxt.scau.edu.cn/Open/RecruitTkssTmYbm/Signin.aspx，点击“报名”，进入“华南农业大学硕士（推荐免试）研究生招生预报名系统”，进行预报名。考生端操作手册详见附件1。</span></p><p><span>2.考生须将以下材料，提交至学院联系人电子邮箱：2225616975@qq.com。</span></p><p><span>（1）第二代居民身份证及学生证复印件；</span></p><p><span>（2）加盖学校教务处公章的本科成绩单1份；</span></p><p><span>（3）国家英语四、六级证书或成绩单、TOEFL或GRE成绩等体现自身英语水平的证明；</span></p><p><span>（4）其他证明申请人学术水平和业务能力的学术论文或获奖证书等材料复印件。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>推免生奖学金激励制度</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>根据《华南农业大学研究生国家奖助学金实施办法》，硕士生新生中的推免生在第一学年享受一等奖学金（10000元/生）。</span></p><p><span>学院增加以下鼓励措施：</span></p><p><span>1. 推免生入学后，学院将给予推免生奖学金奖励1000元/生。</span></p><p><span>2. 本校推免生攻读我院各专业研究生的，在学生自愿的前提下，提前跨级跟随所在专业研究生一年级修读相关专业课程，并按学校有关规定计算为研究生阶段学分。</span></p><p><span>3. 推免生就读研究生期间，有优先报名成为学院助教、助管的资格。</span></p><p><span>4.学院优先推荐推免生（就读研究生期间）参与各项学术交流活动。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>联系人：龙老师、黄老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：020-85283054</span></p><p><span>联系邮箱：2225616975@qq.com</span></p><p><span>通讯地址：广东省广州市天河区五山路483号华南农业大学兽医学院（邮编：510642）</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>兽医学院</span></p><p><span>2026年9月9日</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/6jsOs04VPIT1EX3LpRdMVJaXb5YPy7B8rR4ICFs5G9dIatoZDx5FwLqsmy7v5IFNUYgAy6zsOOVWlLzick7vMWWlH8swCk320TD2GJeCyYk0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>来源 | 华南农业大学兽医学院</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 葛思群 甘瑞诗</span></p><p><span>初审 | </span><span>龙小铃</span></p><p><span>复审 | 孙坚</span></p><p><span>终审 | 戴雪飞</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/6jsOs04VPIRNH2WO6X5ZbvyibyI1fSXt0UicxujiawofoicuPHhCofTdEGHeQ51hwl5W8Ph5EgeKVYEjVm4WKq51rBiaS8BOxl7o2vWIiavPOytX4/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"f55f4fec73a2f32ffcb11917f501bef46d75d10a28fd10e4efb7f9d01354ba34","textLength":978,"sourceSha256":"c67a2e6ffe9bff3668ccff47a1fc893cb68e623ecd49d02204096c63c7417fe1","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7b0979f64f2ec4b93bef","title":"2026年华南农业大学兽医学院关于接收2027年推荐免试研究生预通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:56.120040+00:00"}
